<hr/>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seal_script" title="Seal script">Seal</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Large_seal_script" title="Large seal script">Large</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Small_seal_script" title="Small seal script">Small</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bird-worm_seal_script" title="Bird-worm seal script">Bird-worm</a></li></ul></li></ul>
