<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Asian_Gothic_typeface" title="East Asian Gothic typeface">Hei</a></li></ul></li></ul></div></div></td>
</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed hlist"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)">Properties and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_character_classification" title="Chinese character classification">classification</a></div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_character_components" title="Chinese character components">Components</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_character_strokes" title="Chinese character strokes">Strokes</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroke_order" title="Stroke order">order</a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_character_radicals" title="Chinese character radicals">Radicals</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_characters#Printing_and_typefaces" title="Chinese characters">Orthography</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiu_zixing" title="Jiu zixing"><i>jiu zixing</i></a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xin_zixing" title="Xin zixing"><i>xin zixing</i></a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CJK_characters" title="CJK characters">Digital encoding</a></li></ul></div></div></td>
</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed blist"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)">Collation and standards</div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kangxi_Dictionary_form" title="Kangxi Dictionary form" class="mw-redirect"><i>Kangxi Dictionary</i> forms</a> (1716)</li></ul>
<hr/>
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Commonly_Used_Standard_Chinese_Characters" title="List of Commonly Used Standard Chinese Characters">Commonly Used Characters</a></i> (PRC,<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>2013)</li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Graphemes_of_Commonly-Used_Chinese_Characters" title="List of Graphemes of Commonly-Used Chinese Characters">Commonly-Used Characters</a></i> (Hong<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>Kong,<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>2007)</li></ul>
