<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_Form_of_National_Characters" title="Standard Form of National Characters">Standard Form of National Characters</a></i> (Taiwan,<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>1982)</li></ul>
