</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed hlist"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)">Reforms</div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_characters" title="Simplified characters" class="mw-redirect">Simplified characters</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_round_of_simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Second round of simplified Chinese characters">second round</a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_characters" title="Traditional characters" class="mw-redirect">Traditional characters</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Debate_on_traditional_and_simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Debate on traditional and simplified Chinese characters">debate</a></li></ul></li></ul>
<hr/>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_script_reform" title="Japanese script reform">Japanese script reform</a>
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyūjitai" title="Kyūjitai">kyūjitai</a></i></li></ul></li></ul></div></div></td>
</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed hlist"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Homograph#In_Chinese" title="Homograph">Homographs</a> and readings</div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Literary_and_colloquial_readings" title="Literary and colloquial readings">Literary and colloquial readings</a></li></ul>
<hr/>
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanbun" title="Kanbun">Kanbun</a></i></li></ul>
<hr/>
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idu_script" title="Idu script">Idu</a></i></li></ul></div></div></td>
</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed hlist"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Variant_Chinese_characters" title="Variant Chinese characters">Variants</a></div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_characters_of_Empress_Wu" title="Chinese characters of Empress Wu">Zetian characters</a></li></ul></div></div></td>
</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed hlist"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)">Derived systems</div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content">
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kana" title="Kana">Kana</a></i>
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Man'yōgana" title="Man'yōgana">man'yōgana</a></i></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hiragana" title="Hiragana">hiragana</a></i></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katakana" title="Katakana">katakana</a></i></li></ul></li></ul>
<hr/>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurchen_script" title="Jurchen script">Jurchen script</a></li>
<li>Khitan
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khitan_large_script" title="Khitan large script">large</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khitan_small_script" title="Khitan small script">small</a></li></ul></li></ul>
